      "sourceTextSha256": "dcaabfbd84da69462e5c58e735e11cf22e4724f3d7357bce2bb5e58f597b3afa",
      "text": "Day 7 · After breakfast, excursion to Tierra del Fuego National Park, Argentina’s southernmost national park and one of the few in the country with a sea coastline, along the Beagle Channel. Along the way, pass the Pipo River and Mount Susana, Ensenada Bay facing Redonda Island, Lake Roca and Lapataia Bay, among lagoons, beaver dams and a forest house: rocky mountains, picturesque rivers, valleys and lakes.",
